---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import PageHero from '@/components/pages/PageHero.astro'
import PageFoot from '@/components/pages/PageFoot.astro'
import ProjectCover from '@/components/pages/ProjectCover.astro'
import ProjectNav from '@/components/pages/ProjectNav.astro'
import ProjectDetailMotion from '@/components/pages/ProjectDetailMotion.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Games Lab · 陈润森"
  description="Games Lab：把棋盘规则、弹幕生存与 Godot 竞技场做成可试玩的游戏集合。"
>
  <PageHero
    kicker="project · 2025"
    title="Games Lab"
    summary="把棋盘规则、弹幕生存与 Godot 竞技场做成可试玩的游戏集合。"
  />

  <main class="p-page p-detail">
    <nav class="p-crumbs" data-reveal aria-label="所在位置">
      <a href="/">首页</a>
      <span class="p-crumbs__sep">/</span>
      <a href="/projects">项目</a>
      <span class="p-crumbs__sep">/</span>
      <span aria-current="page">Games Lab</span>
    </nav>
    <div class="p-detail-meta" data-flow data-intersect>
      <span class="p-detail-meta__badge">active</span>
      <span>2025 · 持续迭代</span>
      <span>project 04 / 08</span>
    </div>
    <ProjectCover slug="games-lab" />
    <div class="p-prose" data-intersect>
      <p>游戏是最喜欢的实验田：规则要硬，手感要软。</p>
      <h2>收进来的三类尝试</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>浏览器里的经典棋盘变体——多棋类合集，规则、对局与复盘一页搞定；</li>
        <li>Vampire Survivors 式的弹幕生存 Roguelite；</li>
        <li>
          Godot 引擎里的竞技场原型——升级、构筑、诅咒词条一应俱全。
        </li>
      </ul>
      <h2>试玩与源码</h2>
      <p>
        一部分作品直接内置在本站的<a href="/benchmarks">反应力实验室</a
        >，即点即玩；完整源码都在 GitHub
        上开放，欢迎翻进仓库看实现细节。
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="p-chips" data-flow data-intersect>
      <span class="p-card__tag">JavaScript</span>
      <span class="p-card__tag">GDScript</span>
      <span class="p-card__tag">Godot</span>
    </div>
    <div class="p-card__actions" data-flow data-intersect>
      <a class="p-card__link" href="/benchmarks" data-seal> 站内试玩 </a>
      <a
        class="p-card__link"
        href="https://github.com/SSC-STUDIO/Multi-Board-Game-Collection"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        data-seal
      >
        Multi-Board-Game-Collection
      </a>
      <a
        class="p-card__link"
        href="https://github.com/SSC-STUDIO/GreedySnake-2026"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        data-seal
      >
        GreedySnake-2026
      </a>
    </div>
    <ProjectNav slug="games-lab" />

    <ProjectDetailMotion />
  </main>

  <PageFoot current="/projects" />
</BaseLayout>
